{"type":"message","id":"347f52fe","parentId":"ead4274b","timestamp":"2026-03-21T02:11:34.791Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5b9aaefe","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Live Football Dashboard - Backend\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Create virtual environment:\n   ```bash\n   python -m venv venv\n   source venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac\n   # or\n   .\\venv\\Scripts\\activate  # Windows\n   ```\n\n2. Install dependencies:\n   ```bash\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\n   ```\n\n3. Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and configure:\n   ```bash\n   cp .env.example .env\n   ```\n\n4. Run the server:\n   ```bash\n   python app/main.py\n   ```\n\n## API Endpoints\n\n- `GET /api/live-matches` - Get all live football matches\n- `GET /api/matches/{match_id}` - Get match details\n- `GET /api/matches/{match_id}/stats` - Get match statistics\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet these in `.env`:\n- `LIVESPORT_URL` - Base URL for scraping\n- `CACHE_TTL` - Cache TTL in seconds (default: 60)\n- `UPDATE_INTERVAL` - How often to refresh data (default: 30 seconds)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774059094789}}
{"type":"message","id":"70f0ab8d","parentId":"347f52fe","timestamp":"2026-03-21T02:11:34.794Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b666e9d6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Frontend Starter\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Install dependencies:\n   ```bash\n   npm install\n   ```\n\n2. Run development server:\n   ```bash\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n\n3. Build for production:\n   ```bash\n   npm run build\n   ```\n\n## Features\n\n- Live match list with real-time updates\n- Match details view\n- Statistics dashboard\n- Responsive design\n\n## API Integration\n\nConnect to backend API at `http://localhost:8000`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774059094792}}
